+## Usage
 
----
+```text
+helio                      # start the interactive REPL
+helio run <name>           # launch an instance directly
+helio auth elyby           # sign in with Ely.by (browser OAuth)
+helio auth elyby --password  # password/Yggdrasil fallback
+helio instance create      # create an instance
+helio launch               # launch the active instance
+```
 
