-## Building from Source
+## Data
 
-```
-git clone https://github.com/kalakaritzu/mcsh
-cd mcsh
-dotnet build
-dotnet run
-```
+HelioMC stores data in:
 
-To build the Windows installer:
+- Windows: `%APPDATA%\Helio\`
+- Linux: `~/.local/share/Helio/` (or `$XDG_DATA_HOME/Helio`)
+- macOS: `~/Library/Application Support/Helio/`
 
-```
-build-installer.bat
-```
+On first run, an existing McSH data directory is moved to the Helio location so
+instances and accounts carry over. The authlib-injector JAR is cached there and
+verified by SHA-256.
 
-Requires [.NET 8 SDK](https://dotnet.microsoft.com/download) and the [WiX toolset](https://wixtoolset.org) (`dotnet tool install --global wix`).
